WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.350
One row needs a word.

2
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:05.514
The page prints a placeholder for
the value that identifies Lifecycle

3
00:00:05.514 --> 00:00:09.113
Workflows as the caller, and
copying it would block every call.

4
00:00:09.113 --> 00:00:13.259
The chapter traces the real value:
the page's own bearer-token row,

5
00:00:13.259 --> 00:00:16.779
the page's history, Microsoft's
token claims reference,

6
00:00:16.779 --> 00:00:21.863
and the docs repository's list of known
values all point to the same identifier.

7
00:00:21.863 --> 00:00:26.488
The code uses it, a test pins it, and
Lab 2 still checks it in the tenant.

8
00:00:26.488 --> 00:00:29.725
That leads to the verdict: keep
Learn's shape and trigger,

9
00:00:29.725 --> 00:00:33.580
but don't run it as published for
a leaver's credential revocation.
